res or succumb to the deadly cold of Tartarius</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> - Fragmented worlds in dark and detailed pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through the dark dimensions of Tartarius ends with the final showdown against the Tartariuno. Every choice shapes your destiny in this adventure of redemption and survival.</p>","developers":["Forge 904"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Gabriel Henrique Pereira da Cruz do Nascimento ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810600/779ed590ae4c6ace65ca6843d3e8a410adbfca75/header.jpg?t=1760043105","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810600/1406381388/a094e3981072939b1c1a2854cb18bbf109fc51aa/1758383064/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758386271","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810600/1406381388/a094e3981072939b1c1a2854cb18bbf109fc51aa/1758383064/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758386271","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810600/1406381388/a094e3981072939b1c1a2854cb18bbf109fc51aa/1758383064/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758386271","id":257202833,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202833/movie480.mp4?t=1758386271","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202833/movie_max.mp4?t=1758386271"},"name":"Gameplay ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202833/b451b7663281f4b95bc545276b8ad1f3f3d5836c/movie_6